SUBSCAN  #6  mask 0x005c  taps  4  objective 0.6046
SUBSCAN  #7  mask 0x000f  taps  4  objective 0.6033
SUBSCAN  #8  mask 0x003a  taps  4  objective 0.6024
SUBSCAN  127 supports enumerated. PLANTED TARGET objective 0.6488, RANK 1 of 127.
